WEBVTT

00:00:01.890 --> 00:00:03.440
Moetama!

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:06.770
Wrap your lips around
my plump little curves.

00:00:07.270 --> 00:00:10.780
Also have a taste of
my gooey juices raw!

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:25.840
<i>We never expected our
spur-of-the-moment project</i>

00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:27.500
<i>would lay for us such a golden egg.</i>

00:01:59.340 --> 00:02:00.760
Hey, Kousaku.

00:02:01.080 --> 00:02:03.010
You ever hear tell 'bout "moé rice"?

00:02:03.010 --> 00:02:03.720
"Moé rice"?

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:07.020
The other day I heard tell
'bout it on the news.

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:11.980
When they put rice in packagin' with moé pictures, it sold like hotcakes!

00:02:11.980 --> 00:02:16.360
You reckon it's that
simple to strike it big?

00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:18.120
The results speak for themselves.

00:02:18.120 --> 00:02:19.110
Really?

00:02:19.110 --> 00:02:23.700
A popular illustrator was hired to moé personify Akitakomachi rice.

00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:27.500
The character was printed on bags of rice which were sold online.

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:30.170
In three months, they received 32 tons worth of orders.

00:02:30.920 --> 00:02:33.560
Prior yearly sales had
averaged only 15 tons,

00:02:33.560 --> 00:02:35.920
making those quarterly
sales an eightfold increase.

00:02:36.290 --> 00:02:37.590
That's nuts!

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:42.720
Nowdays, it ain't just the product
but also the packagin' that counts!

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:45.430
I can smell it...

00:02:45.430 --> 00:02:46.680
The sweet scent of cash.

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:48.230
Y-You're...

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:50.020
one of the Four Farm Deities,

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:53.310
Kanegami Torao, aka Money Kanegami!

00:02:55.070 --> 00:02:56.940
The fourth of the Farm Deities?

00:02:56.940 --> 00:02:59.650
Right! The Four Farm Deities who rule Tamo Agricultural!

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:02.610
Number One, Class A's Bounce Yoshida!

00:03:02.610 --> 00:03:05.370
Number Two, Class B's Bio Suzuki!

00:03:05.370 --> 00:03:07.990
Number Three, Class F's Woodman Rintarou!

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:11.290
Number Four, Class E's Rose Hanazono!

00:03:11.610 --> 00:03:14.420
And lastly, our buddy here from Class D.

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:17.710
The Distribution Department's star student, specializing in Agriculture Management,

00:03:17.710 --> 00:03:19.510
Money Kanegami!

00:03:19.510 --> 00:03:20.550
But that's five.

00:03:20.550 --> 00:03:21.430
Don't mention that!

00:03:22.130 --> 00:03:24.390
At long last, I've arrived.

00:03:25.850 --> 00:03:27.390
What business have you, Kanegami?

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:32.480
Is that any way to greet me after my long absence, my dear Kamatori?

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:36.440
I thought you were still suspended from the Kanegami Fund incident.

00:03:36.440 --> 00:03:38.730
My suspension ended yesterday.

00:03:38.730 --> 00:03:40.690
Your chat has piqued my interest.

00:03:40.690 --> 00:03:42.200
Let me join in, will you?

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:43.860
Are you serious?

00:03:43.860 --> 00:03:48.340
It so happens that I, too, was planning to venture into the moé industry.

00:03:48.340 --> 00:03:51.730
It's not an industry that just anyone with a good idea can break into.

00:03:51.730 --> 00:03:53.010
No kiddin'.

00:03:53.010 --> 00:03:54.710
I ain't no expert,

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:59.380
but innit tough to sell without a famous manga artist or illustrator on board?

00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:02.840
I'm way ahead of you.

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:06.890
Believe it or not, I've convinced the famed illustrator,

00:04:06.890 --> 00:04:10.180
Kippu-sensei, to aid in our venture.

00:04:11.390 --> 00:04:13.350
Kippu-sensei? The one and only?!

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:15.310
That's right.

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:18.270
The one who's been making a name illustrating light novels?

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:20.230
The very one.

00:04:20.230 --> 00:04:23.200
And doin' pin-ups for
the web and magazines too!

00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:25.160
You know it!

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:28.780
The Kippu-sensei who was seriously lectured by family about choosing clients

00:04:28.780 --> 00:04:32.540
after agreeing to illustrate a light novel set at an agricultural school and full of dirty jokes?!

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:36.370
Let's leave it at that.

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:39.290
You're telling me <i>that's</i> your illustrator?

00:04:39.290 --> 00:04:41.090
A true professional.

00:04:41.090 --> 00:04:43.840
One of the hottest on the scene, to boot.

00:04:43.840 --> 00:04:45.800
If this won't sell, nothing will.

00:04:46.840 --> 00:04:49.550
I'm starting to think
this plan will really work.

00:04:51.260 --> 00:04:54.600
So will you help? I promise
there'll be something in it for you.

00:04:55.850 --> 00:04:56.900
Help?

00:04:56.900 --> 00:04:57.980
What do you want us to do?

00:04:58.360 --> 00:05:03.240
With my reputation, no one's gonna jump at my proposition.

00:05:03.600 --> 00:05:06.490
But if I have honor students like you on board,

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:08.740
recruitment should go more smoothly.

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:11.580
So we're PR?

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:13.440
All right, I'm in!

00:05:13.440 --> 00:05:15.040
Seein' as Kousaku's helpin'.

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:16.250
Oh, am I?

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:18.290
This here's a matter of risk control.

00:05:18.290 --> 00:05:21.670
If Kane-yan gets carried away,
we could end up in the slammer

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:23.340
where you can't even
go out for groceries.

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:24.300
We're human sacrifices?!

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:27.680
So what is our product?

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:30.220
With the illustrator's name power behind us,

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:32.430
we don't have to worry about
making the product stand out.

00:05:32.430 --> 00:05:36.120
Let's focus instead on
quantity and reliability.

00:05:36.120 --> 00:05:40.110
The best packaging in the world
won't sell a nonexistent product.

00:05:40.110 --> 00:05:45.730
A product at our school with a steady and sizable supply...

00:05:47.980 --> 00:05:49.020
Ain't nothin' else.

00:05:49.020 --> 00:05:50.320
It's the only way to go.

00:05:50.860 --> 00:05:51.820
What is it?

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:54.950
Absolutely not!

00:05:55.270 --> 00:05:57.620
Throw us a bone, Yoshida-san!

00:05:57.620 --> 00:06:00.580
Your eggs are perfect for the job!

00:06:00.580 --> 00:06:01.890
"Moé" my foot!

00:06:01.890 --> 00:06:05.130
I despise frivolity of that ilk!

00:06:05.130 --> 00:06:08.930
Any self-respecting producer should rely on the quality of their product!

00:06:10.010 --> 00:06:11.970
Take a chill pill, girl.

00:06:12.510 --> 00:06:15.810
You already sell them
at the farmers' market.

00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:18.140
We just want to sell
them a bit differently.

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:20.730
Think of it as putting the customer first.

00:06:20.730 --> 00:06:22.120
Kanegami Torao!

00:06:22.120 --> 00:06:23.570
I should have known you were behind this!

00:06:23.570 --> 00:06:28.450
Isn't an agricultural school a place to expand your horizons?

00:06:28.450 --> 00:06:31.780
Save your spiel, you crooked hyena!

00:06:31.780 --> 00:06:33.620
I know what you're <i>really</i> after.

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:37.330
Relax, and think about it.

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:43.880
If we start selling online, your eggs could be on dinner tables all over the country.

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:49.260
M-My eggs... all over the country?

00:06:50.800 --> 00:06:54.180
That's right. All over Japan.

00:06:55.260 --> 00:06:57.850
Could a producer dream of more?

00:06:58.350 --> 00:07:00.480
N-No, but...

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:02.270
we have a duty as local producers...

00:07:02.770 --> 00:07:04.650
to our community and regulars...

00:07:04.650 --> 00:07:06.110
C'mon, little lady.

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:08.570
I'm sure you've heard the stories.

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:11.660
Chicken feed laced with antibiotics

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:14.820
or chicken coops with unsanitary conditions.

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:18.080
If <i>that's</i> how people get their eggs,

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:23.580
wouldn't you rather give them the eggs you farmed with love and care?

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:25.460
Think of the consumers.

00:07:28.550 --> 00:07:30.550
This isn't about money.

00:07:30.550 --> 00:07:32.800
No, more than anything else,

00:07:33.590 --> 00:07:34.970
this is for the consumers.

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:38.430
R-Right.

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:41.520
I can't turn down what's
good for the consumers.

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:44.230
<i>This girl's fallen from grace!</i>

00:07:44.690 --> 00:07:46.560
<i>Well played, Kanegami.</i>

00:07:49.980 --> 00:07:52.110
The name of our product is "Moetama".

00:07:52.110 --> 00:07:56.370
Our marketing efforts will be centered on our mascot, "Ann Fertilized".

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:57.950
Now, let's sell some eggs!

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:01.370
How's the blog looking?

00:08:01.670 --> 00:08:02.770
Right on track!

00:08:02.770 --> 00:08:04.540
We're already generating a buzz.

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:07.000
Great! Start posting the 4-panel manga.

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:08.710
How about the press release to magazines?

00:08:08.710 --> 00:08:11.130
Three anime magazines have picked us up!

00:08:12.710 --> 00:08:14.880
Thanks for calling Moetama.

00:08:14.880 --> 00:08:15.760
Yes.

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:18.100
Of course, please hold.

00:08:18.850 --> 00:08:21.020
They're asking for the
rights to produce a figure.

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:22.020
That was quick.

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:23.060
Early investment?

00:08:23.060 --> 00:08:25.140
No, they only want event rights.

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:27.360
What should we say?

00:08:28.610 --> 00:08:30.190
Let them do as they please.

00:08:30.190 --> 00:08:32.110
There's no risk for us.

00:08:32.110 --> 00:08:35.700
Any free advertising they
provide can only benefit us.

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:37.070
Makes sense!

00:08:37.070 --> 00:08:38.530
Kei, give them the go-ahead!

00:08:38.530 --> 00:08:39.160
Got it.

00:08:40.030 --> 00:08:41.250
Moetama!

00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:44.330
You can be rough when
you peel me bare.

00:08:44.330 --> 00:08:47.040
I can't resist any longer.

00:08:47.580 --> 00:08:49.750
Feel how moist I am.

00:08:50.100 --> 00:08:51.420
Eat me up.

00:08:55.790 --> 00:08:57.510
Thanks for calling Moetama.

00:08:58.050 --> 00:09:02.370
I'm terribly sorry, but we're
currently back-ordered.

00:09:02.370 --> 00:09:06.560
If you place an order now,
it will ship in around three months.

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:10.230
Dagnabbit, we can't fill
these orders fast enough!

00:09:10.230 --> 00:09:11.020
Bad news!

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:13.780
The school's server crashed.

00:09:14.440 --> 00:09:16.530
All the orders must
have overloaded it!

00:09:16.530 --> 00:09:18.490
Uh-oh. The phone lines are gonna be flooded.

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:21.530
Then we've got no choice but
to invest in a lot more phones.

00:09:21.530 --> 00:09:24.500
Well that's fine and dandy,
but we still gotta pack these boxes.

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:25.660
Good point.

00:09:25.660 --> 00:09:26.920
We need more manpower.

00:09:26.920 --> 00:09:28.500
Know anyone we can count on?

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:31.460
<i>My eggs are selling like crazy!</i>

00:09:38.840 --> 00:09:41.510
Our new characters will be twin little sisters!

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:44.350
Double-yolk eggs are rare.

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:45.390
You're on to something.

00:09:46.020 --> 00:09:48.140
This is our boiled egg mascot, Sophie Boyle,

00:09:48.140 --> 00:09:50.610
and our raw egg mascot, Clara White.

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:54.440
One's smooth and shiny,
the other's thick and gooey!

00:09:54.440 --> 00:09:55.490
Bad news!

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:57.360
Kippu-sensei's illustration...

00:09:57.860 --> 00:09:58.820
This is...

00:09:59.830 --> 00:10:01.280
a sexy older gal?

00:10:01.280 --> 00:10:02.120
We're doomed!

00:10:02.120 --> 00:10:03.540
She's too old!

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:05.790
Didn't we commission a loli character?

00:10:06.240 --> 00:10:07.160
Not good!

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:08.830
There was a mix-up in the order!

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:10.500
Seriously?!

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:14.840
Please, we can work with
a sexy older character.

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:16.130
But...

00:10:16.130 --> 00:10:17.800
Since she's smoking hot,

00:10:18.300 --> 00:10:20.800
she'll be our poster girl for smoked eggs.

00:10:22.680 --> 00:10:24.310
Then let's get cracking right away!

00:10:24.310 --> 00:10:24.970
Aye-aye!

00:10:24.970 --> 00:10:26.810
Post a teaser on the official site!

00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:27.390
Got it!

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:34.110
I'm gonna pull out.

00:10:35.570 --> 00:10:37.110
Why, Kei?

00:10:39.360 --> 00:10:42.570
I suppose I had a different vision.

00:10:43.030 --> 00:10:47.330
In the end, shouldn't success
depend on the quality of the product?

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:53.540
There's no point in having
amazing produce if nobody eats it.

00:10:54.040 --> 00:10:56.170
That's why we've gotta sell.

00:10:57.130 --> 00:10:59.220
You're as misguided as ever, Kousaku.

00:11:00.800 --> 00:11:02.640
We're selling the people what they want!

00:11:02.640 --> 00:11:04.010
How is that a bad thing?

00:11:05.390 --> 00:11:06.720
Maybe it's not.

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:09.100
Even so, I'm out.

00:11:10.180 --> 00:11:11.270
Let's go, Jun.

00:11:14.980 --> 00:11:15.900
Hi-yah!

00:11:16.280 --> 00:11:17.280
Kei!

00:11:19.100 --> 00:11:21.200
Don't quit. You're missing out.

00:11:27.840 --> 00:11:32.460
Today we're interviewing the girl
behind Moetama, Yoshida Kochou-san.

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:36.850
She's been hailed online as the overly-endowed agricultural high school student.

00:11:36.850 --> 00:11:39.630
What do you eat
to make them so big?

00:11:39.630 --> 00:11:44.770
W-W-Well, I shupposhe the pwotein-wich Moetama—

00:11:44.770 --> 00:11:47.220
Wait, who asked about my boobs?!

00:11:47.220 --> 00:11:49.680
Yoshida-san's gained quite the following.

00:11:50.680 --> 00:11:52.580
I can hardly contain my laughter.

00:11:52.580 --> 00:11:55.030
Who knew Moetama would sell so well?

00:11:55.030 --> 00:11:57.820
I predicted success, but not to this extent.

00:11:57.820 --> 00:11:58.900
Whoops.

00:11:58.900 --> 00:12:01.350
Never grill till it catches fire.

00:12:01.350 --> 00:12:04.310
Grill the lean side till it's nice and crispy,

00:12:04.310 --> 00:12:06.620
but just lightly sear the fatty side.

00:12:07.020 --> 00:12:07.950
Here.

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:09.410
Really?

00:12:12.710 --> 00:12:13.490
Wow!

00:12:13.490 --> 00:12:14.370
So sweet and fatty!

00:12:14.680 --> 00:12:16.450
Business works the same way.

00:12:16.450 --> 00:12:17.960
You partake when the deal's sweetest.

00:12:18.630 --> 00:12:23.720
But amateurs get greedy and keep grilling till the fat starts to drip away.

00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:31.590
I wonder how far we can take Moetama?

00:12:31.590 --> 00:12:33.300
Moetama is finished.

00:12:33.300 --> 00:12:34.890
This is where we pull out.

00:12:35.810 --> 00:12:36.520
How come?

00:12:37.010 --> 00:12:42.070
A local poultry company wants
to buy the Moetama trademark.

00:12:42.070 --> 00:12:46.200
The school is seriously considering it as a way to support local industry.

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:47.450
They can't just do that!

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:49.750
Let's face it: we're students.

00:12:49.750 --> 00:12:53.580
We won't get rich selling
school-owned produce.

00:12:53.580 --> 00:12:54.410
Still!

00:12:54.410 --> 00:12:56.320
Hear me out, chief.

00:12:56.320 --> 00:12:59.130
School isn't a place to make money.

00:12:59.830 --> 00:13:01.630
It's a place to acquire skills.

00:13:03.200 --> 00:13:05.360
As long as you master the right techniques,

00:13:05.360 --> 00:13:07.970
there will be plenty of time to profit after graduation.

00:13:08.660 --> 00:13:16.670
For now, let's focus on testing our limits
in this no-risk environment while we still can.

00:13:18.350 --> 00:13:22.560
Besides, the network you
build at school is an asset.

00:13:22.560 --> 00:13:25.570
One far more valuable
than mere capital.

00:13:28.520 --> 00:13:33.040
We've already eaten our fill
of the juiciest bits.

00:13:36.600 --> 00:13:38.170
Kanegami...

00:13:38.170 --> 00:13:39.250
Yeah?

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:43.710
It's just, I always thought money was all that mattered to you.

00:13:44.390 --> 00:13:47.320
I won't lie. I love raking it in.

00:13:47.320 --> 00:13:51.000
But there's more to life than that.

00:13:51.000 --> 00:13:54.680
Money is just one aspect.

00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:58.690
I'm well aware there are more important things.

00:13:58.690 --> 00:14:01.490
That's what drives me to make money.

00:14:01.490 --> 00:14:02.820
Kanegami...

00:14:03.790 --> 00:14:06.530
Anyway, Moetama's yesterday's news.

00:14:08.110 --> 00:14:10.920
Next, we're going to be
carving out a new demographic.

00:14:10.920 --> 00:14:12.120
A new demographic?

00:14:13.870 --> 00:14:15.750
After men comes women.

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:16.640
I'm talking BL.

00:14:16.640 --> 00:14:18.750
The B in "Class B" stands for "BL"!

00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:20.900
Whoa! You scared me.

00:14:20.900 --> 00:14:24.310
You're late, "Bio" Suzuki Akari.

00:14:24.310 --> 00:14:27.010
Pardon me! I'll have a Newpis, straight please.

00:14:27.370 --> 00:14:28.720
What's going on here?

00:14:29.110 --> 00:14:32.370
Right now, the otaku industry's prime target is women.

00:14:32.370 --> 00:14:35.390
They're the biggest spenders
when it comes to merchandise.

00:14:36.270 --> 00:14:40.770
Women shell out for what they're
passionate about, be it romance or hobbies.

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:43.440
I see where you're going,
but what's our product?

00:14:43.440 --> 00:14:47.590
Remember when Class F cultivated mushrooms on logs in class?

00:14:47.590 --> 00:14:52.370
When they inoculated logs with mushroom spawn to grow shiitake and shimeji?

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:54.230
That's right.

00:14:54.230 --> 00:14:55.830
Our next product is mushrooms.

00:14:55.830 --> 00:15:01.250
D-Don't tell me you're gonna try moé mushrooms next.

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:03.060
Don't get ahead of yourself.

00:15:03.060 --> 00:15:07.300
Our focus won't be the mushrooms but what they're grown on.

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:09.410
In other words, the logs.

00:15:09.410 --> 00:15:10.340
So what are you saying?

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:12.800
In essence...

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:17.270
Okay, you are <i>sick</i>!

00:15:17.720 --> 00:15:19.560
Have an open mind.

00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:22.310
None of these are long-term plans.

00:15:22.310 --> 00:15:25.320
Get in, turn a profit, and then get out.

00:15:23.040 --> 00:15:27.080
Lovely... So lovely!

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:28.780
High-impact hit-and-run tactics
are the foundation of business ventures.

00:15:28.780 --> 00:15:31.830
Still, I think you're taking this a bit far.

00:15:31.830 --> 00:15:34.030
Suzuki, I could use some backup.

00:15:34.030 --> 00:15:37.490
What if we put a bit of yogurt on the tip of that mushroom?

00:15:37.490 --> 00:15:39.800
And she's gotten <i>worse</i>!

00:15:39.800 --> 00:15:46.380
If we use Class B's sprayable yogurt,
I'm sure the mushrooms will grow fleshy and erect.

00:15:48.210 --> 00:15:50.000
Interesting.

00:15:50.000 --> 00:15:51.670
More interesting than a raving madman!

00:15:52.160 --> 00:15:53.380
This is gonna sell.

00:15:55.200 --> 00:15:57.600
Never insult a Woodman!

00:15:58.000 --> 00:15:59.560
No kidding.

00:15:59.560 --> 00:16:01.620
Let's take this to the roof.

00:16:01.620 --> 00:16:02.790
I'm pissed.

00:16:02.790 --> 00:16:05.020
I don't remember the last time I was this goddamn pissed.

00:16:05.770 --> 00:16:08.230
Can't you reconsider?

00:16:08.230 --> 00:16:11.650
Class F's technical skill and teamwork are just what we need.

00:16:11.650 --> 00:16:13.990
You think we learned
those fancy skills

00:16:14.490 --> 00:16:16.950
so we could work on
retarded schemes like this?

00:16:17.560 --> 00:16:19.660
<i>Damn, that's so true it's sad.</i>

00:16:20.440 --> 00:16:22.530
Hey now, Rintarou,

00:16:22.530 --> 00:16:25.540
are you telling me this is too hard?

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:28.460
Is that why you're making
all these excuses to refuse?

00:16:28.800 --> 00:16:31.480
There's nothing technically
challenging about it.

00:16:31.480 --> 00:16:34.500
You drill a hole in the log,
hammer in the chip spawn,

00:16:34.500 --> 00:16:36.130
and wait for the shiitake to grow.

00:16:36.130 --> 00:16:38.970
So you can easily make mushrooms sprout from the crotch—

00:16:38.970 --> 00:16:40.930
Fuck off!

00:16:41.520 --> 00:16:43.090
I wish I could.

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:45.690
Such a shame.

00:16:46.350 --> 00:16:52.740
This would have been Forestry's chance to impress all the dirty girls in Japan.

00:16:52.740 --> 00:16:53.400
Dirty?

00:16:53.860 --> 00:16:54.870
You heard me.

00:16:54.870 --> 00:16:58.450
Our main target is
homo-loving fujoshi.

00:16:58.450 --> 00:17:00.830
Erotic fantasies are their thing.

00:17:01.480 --> 00:17:02.790
Homey and loving?

00:17:03.300 --> 00:17:05.540
Perfect wife material!

00:17:07.170 --> 00:17:10.960
Come to think of it, Class F is the sort of thing fujoshi would eat right up!

00:17:10.960 --> 00:17:15.760
You're all guys, and you've got that macho Shinsengumi thing going.

00:17:15.760 --> 00:17:17.020
Right, chief?

00:17:17.690 --> 00:17:19.800
O-Oh, yeah, totally!

00:17:19.800 --> 00:17:21.540
But ah, what a shame.

00:17:21.540 --> 00:17:23.120
If this plan had succeeded,

00:17:23.120 --> 00:17:27.350
your name and face would've been
known nationwide, like our girl Yoshida.

00:17:27.350 --> 00:17:30.900
Then next year, girl after girl would apply to the Forestry Department...

00:17:31.220 --> 00:17:33.730
Let's hear this offer of yours, Kousaku-kun.

00:17:39.450 --> 00:17:41.270
Our product is called:

00:17:41.270 --> 00:17:43.910
"C'mon, baby, it's ripe for the picking.

00:17:43.910 --> 00:17:45.620
My mushroom!"

00:17:46.120 --> 00:17:49.330
I've gathered all the edible
mushrooms I could think of.

00:17:49.860 --> 00:17:54.070
Bearing an alluring, dark,
fleshy cap, the classic shiitake!

00:17:54.070 --> 00:17:58.530
Gaze upon the bifurcated stem
of the scandalous buna-shimeji!

00:17:58.530 --> 00:18:02.920
Enjoy the hefty shaft of the monster
20-centimeter king trumpet mushroom!

00:18:02.920 --> 00:18:07.590
A sinful aroma wafts from the secret petals of the maitake!

00:18:07.590 --> 00:18:12.240
Your imagination will run wild with the
suggestive sheen and color of the nameko!

00:18:12.240 --> 00:18:15.490
Even the name sounds dirty: mukitake!

00:18:15.490 --> 00:18:20.130
Covering the crotch like a mosaic is the pale cap of the oyster mushroom!

00:18:20.130 --> 00:18:24.830
And to nurture their growth
and stimulate the imagination,

00:18:24.830 --> 00:18:27.540
add the yogurt you spray, ANaL BB!

00:18:28.020 --> 00:18:31.430
Instead of the usual distribution channels,

00:18:31.430 --> 00:18:35.500
we'll sell these products
discreetly via Bio's fujoshi network!

00:18:35.500 --> 00:18:38.550
The shipping labels will say "Beauty Lotion"!

00:18:40.460 --> 00:18:44.100
If word got out that a public school was selling products of this nature,

00:18:44.100 --> 00:18:46.000
we'd be in a world of trouble.

00:18:48.720 --> 00:18:50.640
<i>So, with our business plan in place,</i>

00:18:50.640 --> 00:18:55.020
<i>we ventured forth to tackle markets that none had attempted before!</i>

00:18:56.520 --> 00:18:57.530
<i>And then...</i>

00:18:58.720 --> 00:19:00.210
<i>we got totally busted.</i>

00:19:02.490 --> 00:19:04.290
Well, Hata-kun, you're suspended.

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:17.060
Kinoshita-san, you look lovely in that yukata!

00:19:17.060 --> 00:19:17.800
Really?

00:19:17.800 --> 00:19:18.820
Yep!

00:19:18.820 --> 00:19:21.510
Yukata look better on flat girls!

00:19:24.470 --> 00:19:28.640
Who'd have thought one of your customers would be a student's mother?

00:19:26.050 --> 00:19:27.280
Flat...

00:19:30.760 --> 00:19:32.190
Suspension, huh?

00:19:32.190 --> 00:19:33.990
It's only for three days.

00:19:33.990 --> 00:19:35.440
At least you learned your lesson.

00:19:35.890 --> 00:19:38.080
You got off easy, Hata-kun.

00:19:38.080 --> 00:19:43.300
As the ringleader and a second offender, Kanegami-san got three weeks!

00:19:43.300 --> 00:19:46.950
All of Class F received a severe warning and an educational experience.

00:19:47.350 --> 00:19:49.160
Educational experience?

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:52.260
Their homeroom teacher, Tachikawa-sensei, beat some sense into them.

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:57.570
They'll spend most of summer vacation
atop Mount Ontake.

00:19:57.570 --> 00:19:58.660
Really?

00:19:58.660 --> 00:20:00.800
They've sure got it rough.

00:20:00.800 --> 00:20:02.760
You can say that again.

00:20:03.700 --> 00:20:05.020
Kanegami.

00:20:05.480 --> 00:20:08.350
I've got a new enterprise in mind once my suspension ends.

00:20:08.710 --> 00:20:10.610
Can I count on you again, chief?

00:20:11.630 --> 00:20:12.690
The plan's all set,

00:20:13.270 --> 00:20:15.190
but I want your talent.

00:20:15.190 --> 00:20:16.150
What do you say?

00:20:22.240 --> 00:20:23.440
I see.

00:20:24.020 --> 00:20:25.360
Can't say I'm surprised.

00:20:31.600 --> 00:20:32.710
Chief.

00:20:34.300 --> 00:20:36.290
There's one thing I want to know.

00:20:40.360 --> 00:20:41.960
Did you enjoy yourself?

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:45.390
You bet.

00:20:48.540 --> 00:20:50.180
Then that's enough.

00:20:55.250 --> 00:20:57.620
I'm gonna dabble in virtual pets next.

00:20:57.620 --> 00:21:00.610
Is that what they call super-
submissive <i>uke</i> characters?

00:21:01.440 --> 00:21:03.550
They ain't learned a thing.

00:21:04.970 --> 00:21:06.070
Look, bamboo!

00:21:06.990 --> 00:21:09.280
Let's write Tanabata wishes!

00:21:11.680 --> 00:21:13.220
What should I write?

00:21:13.220 --> 00:21:14.310
Done!

00:21:14.310 --> 00:21:15.540
Me too.

00:21:18.120 --> 00:21:19.590
All done!

00:21:20.310 --> 00:21:25.170
You've got quite a lot... of wishes... don't you...

00:21:25.960 --> 00:21:27.620
You're gonna tie <i>these</i> up?

00:21:28.270 --> 00:21:29.930
Speaking of tying up!

00:21:30.650 --> 00:21:32.390
Bondage is A-OK!

00:21:34.310 --> 00:21:36.190
How sexually frustrated <i>are</i> you?

00:21:37.440 --> 00:21:40.190
What did everyone else wish...

00:21:46.820 --> 00:21:47.820
<i>The Tanabata festival.</i>

00:21:48.680 --> 00:21:51.740
<i>Although everyone wished for something different,</i>

00:21:52.790 --> 00:21:57.160
<i>I don't think I can be happy
unless all the others are.</i>

00:21:59.540 --> 00:22:01.600
<i>So I can't do better than this.</i>

00:22:01.600 --> 00:22:02.610
<i>I'm sure.</i>

00:22:03.280 --> 00:22:04.880
<i>We'll end on that note.</i>

00:23:38.000 --> 00:23:39.730
"Sob Salad".
